{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31331","headline":"酬李常侍立秋日奉诏祭岳见寄 · 周墀","name":"酬李常侍立秋日奉诏祭岳见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋祠灵岳奉尊罍，风过深林古柏开。\n莲掌月高珪币列，金天雨露鬼神陪。\n质明三献虽终礼，祈寿千年别上杯。\n岂是琐才能祀事，洪农太守主张来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周墀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}